// Supertrend
//
// An ATR-width band that RATCHETS: it may only tighten while price stays on its side, and
// flips when price closes through. Follow the flip.
//
// The ratchet is the whole indicator — a plain band at mid ± ATR would whipsaw on every
// bar. `dir` is +1 in an uptrend and -1 in a downtrend, and reads 0 during ATR warmup,
// which is why the entries test the flip rather than the sign.
strategy("Supertrend", overlay = true)

[line, dir] = supertrend(10, 3)

plot(line, title = "Supertrend", color = color.accent)

if dir == 1 and dir[1] == -1
    strategy.entry("trend", strategy.long)

if dir == -1 and dir[1] == 1
    strategy.close("trend")
